    "body": "How do you measure the most common indent level? It looks to me like an intent of 1 is much more common. When I normalized the style of the WebVTT spec, which copied its initial text from HTML, I ended up with an intent of 1 and line length of 100 as the configuration that resultet in the fewest changes if applied everywhere.\n",
